{"id": "e139", "source": "w2", "locator": "§Test · Continuous evals in CI", "quote": "Write each task as an eval, meaning the prompt plus the checks that define acceptable (tests pass, lint clean, behavior unchanged, policy followed).", "why": "eval 판정 기준"}
